# Mosquitto ACL - contract bollbot/v1 (telemetry/event ingestion only).
#
# v1 security boundary (Phase 0 ADR-10, Phase 1 rule): the backend MUST NOT send operational
# commands to devices. The ingest service account therefore has READ access only, and there
# are no command/config topics at all. Devices have WRITE access to their own topics only and
# no read access (they cannot receive anything from the cloud).

# Backend ingest service account (read-only).
user svc-ingest
topic read bollbot/v1/+/telemetry
topic read bollbot/v1/+/event/+
topic read bollbot/v1/+/status

# Broker healthcheck account: may only subscribe to a non-device health topic.
user svc-health
topic read gossy/health

# Devices: the broker username is the deviceId (%u). Write-only, own topics only.
# Note: patterns also apply to service accounts, which only yields topics under their own
# "svc-*" name; the ingest validator rejects "svc-*" device IDs.
pattern write bollbot/v1/%u/telemetry
pattern write bollbot/v1/%u/event/pest
pattern write bollbot/v1/%u/event/spray
pattern write bollbot/v1/%u/event/harvest
pattern write bollbot/v1/%u/event/scan
pattern write bollbot/v1/%u/event/pick
pattern write bollbot/v1/%u/status
